Don't worry.

1430
00:48:56.610 --> 00:48:56.990
Take them all.

1431
00:48:57.110 --> 00:48:58.650
Take them all.

1432
00:48:58.650 --> 00:48:59.030
Take them all, and they love him.

1433
00:48:59.030 --> 00:48:59.990
Take them all yours, yeah.

