00:49:08.850 --> 00:49:11.210
We saw his heart come out there at that moment.

1439
00:49:11.210 --> 00:49:11.850
Well, and you...

1440
00:49:11.850 --> 00:49:13.050
Tore me up.

1441
00:49:13.190 --> 00:49:14.010
Tore me up.

