00:50:48.970 --> 00:50:49.230
Yeah.

1490
00:50:49.470 --> 00:50:50.170
Quiet you.

1491
00:50:50.450 --> 00:50:51.030
Quiet you.

1492
00:50:51.250 --> 00:50:52.330
Well, we did it, guys.

1493
00:50:52.510 --> 00:50:52.890
We did it.

1494
00:50:52.890 --> 00:50:53.190
We did it.

1495
