00:54:28.100 --> 00:54:31.400
You'd go in his trailer and the two of you would play through my lunch.

1571
00:54:31.580 --> 00:54:31.820
Uh-huh.

1572
00:54:31.940 --> 00:54:32.380
And I just loved it.

1573
00:54:32.380 --> 00:54:32.780
And you guys would call.

1574
