You'd come over and stick your hand in and listen.

1575
00:54:35.140 --> 00:54:36.480
We'd come over and hang out.

1576
00:54:36.480 --> 00:54:43.420
For years, my alarm clock is banjo music because it would make me think of you guys.

1577
00:54:43.580 --> 00:54:50.080
And sometimes, especially when I was pregnant, if we had a little break, I might take a cat nap and I'd wake up to banjo music.

1578
00:54:50.280 --> 00:54:55.760
And it was like so pleasing that I made my alarm clock banjo because I thought, oh, maybe I won't wake up grumpy.

1579
00:54:56.800 --> 00:54:57.880
Ed and I had so much fun.

1580
00:54:57.940 --> 00:54:59.140
He's a great banjo player.

1581
